# Batch files need Windows (CRLF) line endings: cmd.exe misreads LF-only ones (eg. goto / call :label can fail
# to find a label). Git stores them with LF; this makes every checkout, and the GitHub zip Update-Tool.cmd
# downloads, give them CRLF whatever the git settings of the PC.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
